<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech PSE details Sporitelna H1 results.</title>
<headline>Czech PSE details Sporitelna H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Prague Stock Exchange released partial details on Wednesday of savings bank Ceska Sporitelna a.s.'s first half earnings filed with the bourse, according to Czech accounting standards:</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> after-tax profit	 803.045    vs     1,291.202</p>
<p> net interest income  7,226.002    vs     6,694.662</p>
<p>Note. Full balance sheet filed with the exchange was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
